00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:55.100
Amazing.

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:59.090
She's blindfolded, and yet she's heading straight for the watermelon.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:03.680
She isn't taking it?

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:09.640
Yay! I got a piece, too!

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:11.900
What's Sen doing?!
Yay! I got a piece, too!

00:15:12.420 --> 00:15:14.900
I hit it! I win!

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:18.150
Oh, my God! Wake up, Muneakira!

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:23.490
Um, it's Kojirou-san's victory.

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:27.370
It's the same with her.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:30.040
I'm really sorry!

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:33.540
At this point we don't have a choice.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.420
We'll have to play dirty now.

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:38.850
Hello, girls!

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:41.050
How is the M-1 Grand Prix?

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:44.790
Allow me to announce a special rule fitting for the finals.

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:48.060
The victor in the next match will receive four points.

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:51.060
I wish you all a great battle!

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:52.390
Stare...

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:57.190
I knew it.

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:00.190
<b>Third Match</b>

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:00.210
Sanada Yukimura
Araki Mataemon
<b>Third Match</b>

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:00.620
Araki Mataemon
Sanada Yukimura

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:02.950
This means that the next match might decide who's victorious.

00:16:02.950 --> 00:16:05.200
Hula Hoop Contest
Third Match

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:12.580
Yukimura-san and Mataemon-san will be spinning their
hula hoop within the arena. Who will last longer?

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:15.080
Ready, set...

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:18.590
This is as easy as a pie!

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:20.710
I can do this forever!

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:24.220
Whoa! She's moving precisely like a machine!

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:27.220
I can't win like this.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:30.780
I should provoke her and lead her to ruin.

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:34.230
Huh? Something funny?

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:38.730
You sure take it easy, being so well-endowed and all.

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:41.740
Implying I'm going all out already!

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:46.430
Huh? Is that the best you can do?

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:47.740
How pathetic.

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:51.760
What? I'll show you my true power!

00:17:08.300 --> 00:17:10.140
Hey! I win, right?

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:14.140
Mataemon-san wins!

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:20.770
Whoa. It shows so clearly.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:23.570
I'm really sorry!

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:27.070
Well, at this point we don't have a choice.

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:30.510
We need to play even dirtier.

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:34.370
Next is the last competition of the finals,

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:36.690
but we've got another call from the organizer,

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:39.880
the president of the student council, Tokugawa Yoshihiko!

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:41.850
Wicky. Wicky.

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:43.790
Give back the mic!

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:46.040
Give it back already!

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:52.890
The winner of this final match will receive eight points!

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:58.570
That means the matches so far were meaningless.

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:01.400
Whoever wins the final match takes home the gold!

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:05.400
No one's even watching anymore.

00:18:09.570 --> 00:18:10.790
In the fourth match of the finals,

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:13.040
the two contestants will fight fair and square using their swords

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:15.540
Fair and Square Sword Fight
Fourth Match
to decide who's the better maid!

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:20.190
However, the battlefield has a number of traps!

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:22.040
Be wary of where you step!

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:24.190
Juubei!

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:26.320
Don't worry about winning!

00:18:26.320 --> 00:18:28.000
Just do your best!

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:30.890
Come at me, Fake.

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:33.220
I'm not a fake!

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:35.480
Now then, the final match!

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:37.230
Fair and square! Do your best!

00:18:37.230 --> 00:18:38.980
Ready, set...

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:42.480
I'll do my best!

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:45.980
Show me what your "best" is!

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:51.960
I told you!

00:18:52.280 --> 00:18:55.620
There's no finals without me there!

00:18:58.970 --> 00:19:00.230
That moron!

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:02.330
Now the trap order is all messed up!

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:03.130
Give that to me!

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:09.660
Hey! That didn't work at all!

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:12.510
I calculated everything carefully!

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:14.140
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:19:18.930 --> 00:19:21.400
Disaster's drawing near!

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:32.720
Th-This place is dangerous.

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:33.500
I should get out and-

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:37.790
Great!

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:41.300
Willful bikini-wearing girls are weak against tentacle monsters!

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:42.680
Go, Kanetsugu!

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:44.290
But that's a familiar...

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.330
Pathetic.

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:53.970
I'm not here for some comedy act.

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:56.180
Sorry, but I'll be ending this now.

00:19:56.530 --> 00:19:57.210
This is bad!

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:58.350
Run, Juubei!

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:00.560
Huh? Onii-chan?

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:02.880
Stop it, Musashi!

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:04.410
The contest's over!

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:05.720
We lose!

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:07.570
Who cares about the contest?

00:20:08.150 --> 00:20:11.240
Yagyuu Juubei! Show me what you're capable of!

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:12.740
Yagyuu Ju-

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:16.660
Onii-chan!

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:17.920
Muneakira!

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:19.500
I'll get rid of you first!

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:20.120
Stop!

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:22.290
I'll handle you la-

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:27.290
Don't you dare raise a hand against my Onii-chan!

00:20:44.240 --> 00:20:47.070
I see. I get it now.

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:50.480
What do you get?

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:53.110
You didn't lie.

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:55.500
U-Uh, Musashi-san?

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:58.830
You lose if you leave the battlefield.

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:01.500
I got what I came here for. You can have your victory.

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:03.740
Really?

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:04.500
Yeah.

00:21:04.980 --> 00:21:09.020
Get your power back before the deadline, Yagyuu Juubei.

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:15.010
That means the winner is team True Shadow!

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:16.520
Huh? We win?

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:18.010
Hurray!

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:24.520
The winner of the first M-1 Grand Prix is team True Shadow!

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:26.230
Hurray!

00:21:26.230 --> 00:21:28.150
Onii-chan! We won!

00:21:28.150 --> 00:21:30.790
How did you cheat?

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:32.000
It's a secret!

00:23:11.930 --> 00:23:13.600
It's finally my turn.

00:23:14.440 --> 00:23:18.690
Oh, right. I haven't changed to this form since you came, Sasuke.

00:23:18.690 --> 00:23:20.830
My name is Yagyuu Juubei Mitsuyoshi.

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:22.950
The real one, head to toe.

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:25.650
You're so doubtful.

00:23:25.650 --> 00:23:27.130
You're an animal.

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:28.710
You should know by my scent.

00:23:30.350 --> 00:23:32.370
Hey, where the hell are you sniffing?!

00:23:32.370 --> 00:23:34.210
Stop! Not there!

00:23:34.940 --> 00:23:37.130
Next, The Rumored Dandy.

00:23:37.960 --> 00:23:39.990
Matabei, why are <i>you</i> sniffing me?!
